Press - attack skill
------------------------------------------------------------
A Swashbuckler can spend most of their Flair to press a
challenged opponent with an immediate attack round.

The target must be your current opponent and must still be
answering your challenge. Press costs no spell points and
has no timer.

GL:  8
Cost: 8 Flair
command: press <target> (defaults to opponent if in combat)
duration: instant
see also: flair, challenge
